      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's possible that the avatar that you're using crashes you.\nIt happened to me. Someone dropped a portal on me. It teleported me to a world which changed my avatar into a crasher avatar.\nWhen I would start the game. I would see my avatar loading (the blue diamond avatar) and the instant it would try to show my avatar I would crash.\nTo fix this log into vrchat.com and go to Avatars: https://vrchat.com/home/avatars\nThen click the <Reset to Default Avatar> button",
